
  <sn><md>### Methods of Expressing Sets

A set can mainly be expressed using **two methods**:

- Tabular Method / Roster form , A = [a,b,c,d..]
- Set Builder Method / Ruler form , A = \{x:x,conditions of x\}
</md></sn>
